import JanusFormal.Branches.FundamentalGeometryPVariationalPrinciple.Gates.P0EFTJanusProgramPD9PrimitiveSpinCFirstPositiveSphereMultiplicity4D

/-!
# Exact exhaustion of the first positive primitive SpinC sphere block

The repository does not yet contain the positive monopole eigenspinor
tower needed to construct arbitrary sphere levels.  This file proves
the strongest unconditional level-one substitute: the coordinate and
tangential geometric seed block is exactly the direct sum of its
positive and negative Dirac eigenspaces.  Each sign has unique
`Fin 3` coordinates and the expected multiplicity three.

The remaining arbitrary-level lock is a construction and completeness
theorem for the global positive monopole eigenspinors; no such data is
assumed here.
-/

namespace JanusFormal
namespace P0EFTJanusProgramPD9PrimitiveSpinCFirstPositiveSphereExhaustion4D

set_option autoImplicit false
noncomputable section

